--- !u!114 &74
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_PrefabParentObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInternal: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 18}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91c670571df477a70e7d1f7fecd4508d, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  tipLabel: {fileID: 82}
  tips:
  - Use the Thunder Scroll to slash through any zombie - even Berserkers!
  - The Gold Scroll not only attracts all coins but also doubles all coin pickups!
  - The Wind Scroll is great for extending your combos!
  - Use the Fire Scroll to double your score multiplier and combo count!
  - Maintaining your combo count is the key to high scores.
  - Complete missions to extend your score multiplier limit up to x100.
  - Use a Multiplier Booster at the start of a game to boost your score!
  - When things get tough, use Shadow Cloaks to protect yourself from death!
  - Swipe down mid-air for a faster landing.
  - Cutting bamboo trees and street lights can also extend your combo count!
  - You can switch lanes mid-air to dodge obstacles.
  - At the village, try to stay on rooftops!
  - Visit the Dojo to select your Ninja and review your mission progress.
  - Get bonus coins every 50 combos! The higher your combo count, the more coins you get.
  - Pick up or purchase Lucky Boxes to collect special character tokens!
  - All zombies are fictitious. Any resemblance to real zombies is purely coincidental.
  - No real zombies were harmed in the making of this game.
  - Running into walls is a great way to die.
  - All ninjas featured are trained professionals. Please do not try this at home.
